A '''storage unit''' can be found in the tent outside the [[Chambers of Xeric]], near the [[bank chest]]. It will contain any items the player left inside a [[Storage unit (disambiguation)|storage unit]] in the Chambers of Xeric, as well as any rewards the player did not retrieve from the [[ancient chest]] at the end of the raid.

